          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabuyela kuJuda, wathi: “Angimtholi; namadoda akuleyondawo athi asikho isifebe kule ndawo.",
          "type": "text",
