          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi emva kwezinyanga ezintathu watshelwa uJuda ukuthi: UTamari umalokazana wakho uphingile; futhi bheka, ukhulelwe ngokuphinga. Wathi uJuda: “Mkhipheni, amshiswe.”",
          "type": "text",
